Classes: [[Paladin]]

Level requirement: 9

Reuse: 15 seconds

Autoskill: Yes 

This ability smites your current target, dealing physical damage as well as converting 6% (rounded down) of your maximum mana into amplified magic damage.

Smite can [[Double Attack|Double]] and [[Triple Attack]].

Smite also reduces the [[Lay on Hands]] cooldown by 60 seconds every time it lands, including the extra hits from double and triple attack.

Macro command: <code>/doability Smite</code>

Skill Cap: 210 at level 50.

